Z||000009||Phil||03-05-2000||03:01 PM||||A stock coupe goes around 2700 empty.||||reg||1
Z||000010||1FST2M6||03-05-2000||03:19 PM||||I pulled ANYthing that didn't make me faster, or stop out of the car...  No A/c compressor, brackets, heat shields, a/c plumbing, steering stablizer, air box, sound deadinging material, fan from the rear of the car.. rear carpet, put Corbeau 11lb seats in it replaced the seat belts with WAY lighter harnesses, replaced some guages with lighter Autometer units... no windshield washer reservoir, (have spare tire though)  then went to the local truck stop had them zero it out drove on and got the weight! Refered to around our shop as Ed's Quick weight loss program    <A HREF="http://www.engineered.net/fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>www.engineered.net/fiero.htm</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000011||1FST2M6||03-05-2000||03:21 PM||||oh and i am rather thin.. 6'2" and 148lbs... ||||reg||1
