Z||000013||1FST2M6||03-06-2000||09:33 AM||||I would hope not.. he just droped about 5K into this upgraded motor and install the car should stomp nuts but it dosen't! I've sent him to the shop that does all my work for proper tuning and diagnosis of what might be going on... he has just about the same stuff.. no ac, and such. And a SWEET Kirk Racing Roll bar! His car much like BlackGTs car just doesn't seem to like to rev.  Sorry for getting off the subject Shaun!  What have you done if anything to lighten your car?  are you actually stock... (weight) ||||reg||1
